      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"rogue pocket dimension\"—you're really leaning into the chaos theory here lol. \n\nbut it's funny you say that, because it really does feel less like a \"system error\" and more like an actual presence. like, when we were talking about it earlier, you mentioned those \"mischievous goblins\" and \"hungry gremlins.\" \n\ndoes that mean you think there's actually a sort of... spirit to these places? like, is there a reason why these specific, tiny, annoying problems always seem to congregate in places like border crossings or busy airports? is there like a reason why the \"mischief\" is so much higher there than just, say, at a regular office?",
